---
// Footer & CTA Final: Conversión comercial multicanal (WhatsApp, Correo, Instagram)
---

<footer id="contacto" class="py-16 md:py-28 border-t border-white/5 bg-[#030304] relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Texto Monumental de Fondo Delineado "GET IN TOUCH" (AutoRelay) -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none select-none z-0">
    <span class="text-6xl sm:text-8xl lg:text-[13rem] font-bold font-heading tracking-widest text-outline-red opacity-15 whitespace-nowrap block">
      GET IN TOUCH
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Bloque de Conversión Final con Domo de Resplandor Carmesí Interior -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl obsidian-card p-8 sm:p-14 mb-16 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Glow sutil de fondo en carmesí -->
      <div class="absolute -top-32 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-red-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#030304] border border-red-500/30 text-xs font-mono text-red-400 mb-6 shadow-[0_0_15px_-3px_rgba(239,68,68,0.25)]">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 shadow-[0_0_6px_#ff2e2e]"></span>
          CANALES DIRECTOS // RESPUESTA RÁPIDA
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 font-heading">
          Hablemos de tu Proyecto, <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-rose-500 to-red-400">Sin Compromiso</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-zinc-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8 font-sans">
          ¿Tienes un local, taller o empresa y sientes que pierdes ventas o tiempo en tareas manuales? Elige el canal que te resulte más cómodo y coordinemos una revisión directa.
        </p>

        <!-- Canales de Contacto: Botón Principal WhatsApp + Canales Secundarios -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <!-- Botón Principal: WhatsApp -->
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/56937508655?text=Hola,%20me%20gustaría%20coordinar%20una%20demostración%20rápida%20para%20mi%20negocio."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-crimson-glow inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-base tracking-tight font-heading w-full sm:w-auto shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(239,68,68,0.3)]"
          >
            <!-- Ícono WhatsApp -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>WhatsApp (+56 9 3750 8655)</span>
          </a>

          <!-- Botón Secundario: Instagram -->
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com/im.vicnad"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0e0e12] hover:bg-[#14141a] border border-white/10 hover:border-red-500/40 text-zinc-200 hover:text-white font-mono text-sm transition-all w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            <!-- Ícono Instagram -->
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current text-rose-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Instagram: @im.vicnad</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Correo Electrónico Laboral Directo -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
          <span>O escríbeme a mi correo laboral:</span>
          <a
            href="mailto:vic.d.nav@hotmail.com"
            class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300 font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
          >
            vic.d.nav@hotmail.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra Inferior de Información Técnica & Copyright -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between pt-8 border-t border-white/5 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-mono gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <!-- Logotipo Monocromático Pequeño -->
        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-black border border-red-500/30 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/logo.webp"
            alt="Logo"
            class="w-full h-full object-contain"
            width="28"
            height="28"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <span class="text-zinc-300 font-medium">imVic • Desarrollo de Software &amp; Ciberseguridad</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6">
        <a href="https://wa.me/56937508655" target="_blank" class="hover:text-red-400 transition-colors">
          WhatsApp: +56 9 3750 8655
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:vic.d.nav@hotmail.com" class="hover:text-red-400 transition-colors">
          vic.d.nav@hotmail.com
        </a>
        <a href="https://instagram.com/im.vicnad" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-red-400 transition-colors">
          @im.vicnad
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="text-zinc-500">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Todos los derechos reservados.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
